msgid "What to do with the form. \"delete\" is permanent."
msgstr "Wat te doen met het formulier. \"verwijderen\" is permanent."

#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:1799
msgid "Returns donation trend data grouped by day, week, or month for a single currency. Supports date-range and campaign filtering; defaults to the last 30 days in the store currency. Useful for charts and analytics."
msgstr "Geeft donatietrendgegevens terug, gegroepeerd per dag, week of maand voor een enkele valuta. Ondersteunt datum- en campagnefiltering; standaard is de laatste 30 dagen in de winkelvaluta. Handig voor grafieken en analyses."

#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:1808
msgid "Start date (YYYY-MM-DD). Empty defaults to 30 days ago."
msgstr "Startdatum (JJJJ-MM-DD). Leeg standaard is 30 dagen geleden."

#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:1813
msgid "End date (YYYY-MM-DD). Empty defaults to today."
msgstr "Einddatum (JJJJ-MM-DD). Leeg standaard is vandaag."

#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:1824
#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:1882
#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:1927
#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:1984
msgid "Three-letter currency code to report on. Defaults to the store currency. Amounts across currencies are never summed together."
msgstr "Drieletterige valutacode om over te rapporteren. Standaard is de winkelvaluta. Bedragen in verschillende valuta's worden nooit samen opgeteld."

