msgid "Limit to one campaign (0 for all campaigns)."
msgstr "Beperk tot één campagne (0 voor alle campagnes)."

#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:1835
msgid "Report on test or live donations. Defaults to the store's current mode."
msgstr "Rapporteer over test- of live donaties. Standaard is de huidige modus van de winkel."

