#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:1922
msgid "How many donations to return (max 100)."
msgstr "Hoeveel donaties moeten worden geretourneerd (maximaal 100)."

#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:1969
msgid "Get top campaigns"
msgstr "Ontvang topcampagnes"

#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:1970
