msgid "Get donation settings"
msgstr "Ontvang donatie-instellingen"

#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:2021
msgid "Returns the non-sensitive store settings: currency and how its symbol is positioned, whether payments are in test or live mode, and the donor/spam options. Payment credentials and the AI settings that gate these abilities are never returned."
msgstr "Geeft de niet-gevoelige winkelinstellingen terug: valuta en hoe het symbool is gepositioneerd, of betalingen in test- of livemodus zijn, en de donor/spamopties. Betalingsgegevens en de AI-instellingen die deze mogelijkheden beperken, worden nooit geretourneerd."

#: inc/abilities/config-ability.php:2036
msgid "test or live. Global, not per gateway."
msgstr "test of live. Globaal, niet per gateway."

